Cell["\<\
Definition: the density of a shape is the number of times it covers each \
vertex: once for a vertex, once per occurrence in a vertex list, and once per \
walk through the vertex for a family of walks.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"18613e29-7741-4c2c-a05f-bbef0b533c12"],

Cell["It reads every shape:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a1bc5c9e-8abf-4b05-aa4f-eafc7a604875"],

